  Description: "COMPANION / UNCOMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nCollecting a heart attempts
    1 extra HP of healing while at least one Ribbon Otter talent is owned. Extra
    healing does not stack by copies; hero healing restrictions apply.\r\n\nSUPPORT
    WHILE OWNED\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support
    sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nA river mender marking safe crossings
    with ribbons. A flood moved a marker; they returned to correct it rather than
    blame those who trusted it. They seek the source and a place to remember the
    missing by name.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nNo additional periodic personal passive.\r\n\nNamed
    talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not
    multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale
    separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: tidal, rain-script. Immortal. Weapon rolls on
    recruitment; three equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent forbids
    it."
